stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> New: Create Case
    New --> Open: Start Process
    Open --> Open: Assignment In Progress
    Open --> Pending: Wait Shape / External Event
    Pending --> Open: Event Received
    Open --> Resolved_Completed: Resolve Case
    Open --> Resolved_Cancelled: Cancel / Withdraw
    Resolved_Completed --> [*]
    Resolved_Cancelled --> [*]

    note right of Open
        Stages contain Processes
        Processes contain Flows
        Flows create Assignments
    end note
